<title>USA: NCS HealthCare buys pharmacy company.</title>
<headline>NCS HealthCare buys pharmacy company.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>NCS HealthCare said on Thursday it had acquired HLF Adult Home Pharmacy for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>NCS said HLF, which provides services in the Rochester and Buffalo, New York markets, had revenues of about $3.7 million.</p>
<p>NCS, which provides pharmacy and related services to long-term care facilities, said the deal marked its entrance into its twenty-third state of operations.</p>
</text>
